{"id":17808,"name":"Shelby County","slug":"shelby-county","state":"Alabama","code":"AL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/alabama-tax-lien-sales-how-to-get-12-interest/shelby-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:23","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Sale","bidProcedure":"Bid down the interest rate from 12%","redemptionPeriod":"3 years","interestRate":"Starts at 12%","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"Varies by year; check the latest schedule on the GovEase Auction Site"},{"label":"Contact for More Info","value":"Shelby County Property Tax Commissioner"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"GovEase"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Shelby County, AL"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"tH8PXIrk2wd5BpeyiTAEgVKQfM6oSvRb9cU1zqsOYCJ0jua3Gx\"><iframe title=\"Exploring Tax Lien Opportunities in Shelby County, Alabama\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JEe5WswkP6E?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"12%-Yearly-Revenue-Streams---Shelby-County,-Alabama-Tax-Lien-Investing\">12% Yearly Revenue Streams &#8211; Shelby County, Alabama Tax Lien Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Investing in tax liens in Shelby County, Alabama, can offer you a fantastic way to grow your money, with potential returns of up to 12% interest annually. This opportunity not only allows you to make a secure investment but also opens the door to acquiring property at a low cost.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-the-Process-Works\">How the Process Works</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The tax lien auction in Shelby County is held online, making it easy and convenient to participate from anywhere. The auction is hosted on <a href=\"http://www.govease.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase</mark></a>, where you can find all the necessary details and register to bid.</p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Register</strong>: First, create an account on GovEase and complete any required paperwork, including submitting a W-9 form.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bidding</strong>: Auctions start with an interest rate of 12%, and bidders compete by lowering this rate. The bidder willing to accept the lowest interest rate wins the lien.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Redemption</strong>: If the property owner pays their overdue taxes, you earn back your investment plus the interest rate you bid. If not, you may eventually foreclose on the property and potentially own it.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Additional-Resources\">Additional Resources</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"http://taxlienauction.shelbyal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Shelby County Tax Lien Auction Flyer</mark></strong></a>: Detailed information on upcoming auctions.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://ptc.shelbyal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Citizen Access Portal</mark></strong></a>: This is for checking tax records and lien details.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shelby-County-Columbiana-Alabama-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17811 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Shelby County Columbiana Alabama\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Thoroughly</strong>: Before bidding, research each parcel thoroughly to understand the property&#8217;s background and any potential issues.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Prepare Financially</strong>: Ensure you have funds ready to pay for any liens you win, including subsequent taxes that may come due.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Understand the Laws</strong>: Familiarize yourself with Alabama&#8217;s tax lien laws, as they can significantly impact your investment.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if the property owner does not redeem the lien?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: If the owner doesn&#8217;t pay their overdue taxes within the redemption period (usually three years), you can initiate foreclosure proceedings and potentially acquire the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Can anyone participate in the Shelby County tax lien auction?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Yes, anyone who registers on GovEase and meets the financial requirements can participate.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How often are these auctions held?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: The auctions are typically held annually. Specific dates and times are published in advance on the <a href=\"http://www.govease.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase Auction Site</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>By staying informed and prepared, you can leverage tax lien investing in Shelby County to secure high returns and possibly acquire valuable real estate at a fraction of its market value.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"http://www.govease.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase Auction Portal</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://ptc.shelbyal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Shelby County Property Tax Commissioner</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.shelbyal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Shelby County Official Website</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/alabama-tax-lien-sales-how-to-get-12-interest/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">How to Earn up to 12% Interest from Alabama&#8217;s Tax Lien Sales</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-investing-overview/understanding-tax-lien-certificates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-c